  'afriforum-protests-tshwane-water-losses-2026-11-25',
  'AfriForum protests Tshwane''s water losses amid resident fines',
  'Utilities', '2026-11-25', 'Rekord', 'https://www.citizen.co.za/rekord/news-headlines/2026/11/25/afriforum-stages-symbolic-protest-over-tshwane-water-losses/',
  'AfriForum protested in Pretoria, accusing Tshwane of fining residents over water restrictions while its own pipes leak an estimated R1.5 billion a year.',
  'AfriForum, a civil rights organisation, held a protest in Pretoria against the City of Tshwane, arguing it is unfair for the metro to penalise residents over water use while its own pipe network keeps losing vast amounts of water. The organisation''s Pretoria spokesperson said the metro should stop going after residents and instead focus on fixing its own leaks.

The protest follows Level 2 water restrictions the city introduced in mid-November, which cap household water use at 20 kilolitres a month. Residents who use more than that can face a fine of at least R5,000 or criminal charges, with the Tshwane Metro Police Department carrying out inspections. The city has said the restrictions are needed because demand on the Rand Water system has outgrown Tshwane''s allocation.

AfriForum points to the city''s own audited 2024/2025 financial statements, which record physical water losses of about R1.36 billion, with the loss rate climbing from roughly 31% to 35% of total supply. Based on this, the organisation estimates Tshwane is now losing close to R1.5 billion a year, or about R4 million a day, through leaking pipes and ageing infrastructure.

The organisation is calling on municipal manager Johann Mettler to prioritise finding and repairing leaks and to present a public plan for cutting the city''s water losses, rather than directing resources toward fining households. AfriForum said it intends to keep documenting water wastage across the metro and keep up pressure on officials for repairs. The City of Tshwane did not respond to requests for comment on the protest.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.citizen.co.za/rekord/news-headlines/2026/11/25/afriforum-stages-symbolic-protest-over-tshwane-water-losses/", "https://businesstech.co.za/news/?p=885016"]',
  'agent'
);
